"21. During testing of a UPS (Uninterruptible Power Supply) system, the inspector performs an autonomy test at full load. The UPS is specified for 30-minute autonomy at 100 kW load. After 22 minutes at full load, the UPS output voltage drops below the acceptable range and the inverter shuts down. What is the finding?",
